 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $34,942M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":0,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 92.9%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 0.22"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":10.83,"default_fair_val":10.83,"premium_pct":-10.43397968605726,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":12,"pe_forward":10.6,"pb_trailing":2.5,"pb_forward":2.2,"div_yield":6.02,"ps_ratio":0.8,"fcf_to_ev":1.63,"fcf_to_mcap":32.68,"liab_to_assets":92.9,"cash_to_assets":12.3,"current_ratio":0.22,"roe":21.2,"roa":1.4,"moat":{"ticker":"ITUB","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Itaú 在巴西金融市場擁有極高的品牌聲譽與客戶忠誠度，這使其在定價上具有一定的優勢，尤其是在財富管理和個人銀行業務。雖然銀行業整體競爭激烈，但 Itaú 的品牌價值能吸引並留住高淨值客戶，並在提供貸款和金融產品時獲得略優的定價能力。這種品牌力量是其核心競爭力之一，但仍需面對來自新興金融科技公司和大型銀行的挑戰。","comment_en":"Itaú boasts a strong brand reputation and customer loyalty in the Brazilian financial market, granting it pricing power, particularly in wealth management and retail banking. Despite intense competition in the banking sector, Itaú's brand attracts and retains high-net-worth clients, enabling slightly better pricing for loans and financial products. This brand equity is a core strength, though it faces challenges from fintechs and other large banks."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"巴西的銀行業受到嚴格的監管，這對新進入者構成了顯著的進入壁壘。Itaú 作為一家歷史悠久且合規的大型銀行，能夠更好地應對複雜的監管環境。雖然沒有專利保護，但其對監管規則的深刻理解和適應能力，以及與監管機構的良好關係，構成了事實上的特許經營壁壘，限制了競爭對手的快速發展。","comment_en":"Brazil's banking sector is heavily regulated, creating significant barriers to entry for new players. Itaú, as an established and compliant large bank, navigates this complex regulatory landscape effectively. While lacking patent protection, its deep understanding and adaptation to regulations, along with established relationships with authorities, act as a de facto franchise barrier, limiting rapid growth for competitors."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"對於大多數客戶而言，更換銀行涉及複雜的流程，包括轉移帳戶、自動扣款、貸款協議等，這構成了顯著的轉換成本。Itaú 透過其廣泛的服務網絡、數位化平台和客戶關係管理，進一步鞏固了客戶黏性。雖然數位銀行可能降低部分轉換門檻，但對於需要全面金融服務的客戶，轉換成本依然是維持客戶留存的重要因素。","comment_en":"For most customers, switching banks involves complex processes like transferring accounts, direct debits, and loan agreements, creating substantial switching costs. Itaú reinforces customer stickiness through its extensive service network, digital platforms, and CRM. While digital banks may lower some barriers, for customers requiring comprehensive financial services, switching costs remain a key factor in retention."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Itaú 的網絡效應主要體現在其龐大的客戶基礎和廣泛的銀行分行及 ATM 網絡。更多的客戶使用其服務，增加了平台的價值，尤其是在支付和轉帳方面。同時，其龐大的商戶網絡也吸引了更多消費者。然而，與科技平台相比，銀行業的網絡效應相對較弱，且數位支付的興起可能分散部分網絡效應。","comment_en":"Itaú's network effects are primarily evident in its vast customer base and extensive network of branches and ATMs. More customers using its services increase the platform's value, especially for payments and transfers. Its large merchant network also attracts more consumers. However, network effects in banking are generally weaker compared to tech platforms, and the rise of digital payments may dilute some of these effects."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"作為巴西最大的銀行之一，Itaú 受益於顯著的規模經濟。其龐大的資產規模使其能夠攤薄固定成本（如技術投資、合規成本），並在資金獲取上具有成本優勢。透過優化營運效率和技術應用，Itaú 能夠提供更具競爭力的利率和費用，從而吸引更多客戶，形成正向循環。這種規模優勢是其在激烈市場中保持領先地位的關鍵。","comment_en":"As one of Brazil's largest banks, Itaú benefits from significant economies of scale. Its massive asset base allows it to spread fixed costs (technology, compliance) and gain funding cost advantages. By optimizing operational efficiency and technology, Itaú can offer competitive rates and fees, attracting more customers in a virtuous cycle. This scale advantage is crucial for maintaining its leading position in a competitive market."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Itaú 在巴西金融市場的深厚根基和廣泛的地理覆蓋是其獨特的資產。其龐大的分行網絡和對巴西各地區經濟的深入了解，使其能夠有效服務不同客戶群體。雖然地理位置本身不是絕對壁壘，但 Itaú 在巴西市場的長期經營和建立的信任，使其難以被國內外競爭對手輕易複製。","comment_en":"Itaú's deep roots and extensive geographic coverage in the Brazilian financial market are unique assets. Its vast branch network and profound understanding of Brazil's regional economies enable it to serve diverse customer segments effectively. While geography itself isn't an absolute barrier, Itaú's long-standing operations and established trust in the Brazilian market make it difficult for domestic or foreign competitors to replicate easily."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Itaú 持續投資於技術和流程優化，以提高營運效率。透過數位化轉型，公司能夠降低交易成本、改善客戶體驗並加快服務速度。其較高的 ROE 和 ROA 指標（相較於行業平均）證明了其卓越的營運管理能力。這種效率優勢使其能夠在維持盈利能力的同時，提供更具吸引力的產品和服務。","comment_en":"Itaú consistently invests in technology and process optimization to enhance operational efficiency. Through digital transformation, the company reduces transaction costs, improves customer experience, and speeds up service delivery. Its strong ROE and ROA metrics, relative to industry averages, demonstrate excellent operational management. This efficiency advantage allows it to offer more attractive products and services while maintaining profitability."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"Itaú 在資本配置方面展現出卓越的紀律和智慧。公司歷史上能夠在經濟週期中保持穩健，並透過精準的併購、股權回購和股息發放，為股東創造長期價值。其穩定的盈利能力和對風險的有效管理，使其能夠在適當的時機進行資本部署，例如對新興技術的投資或擴張至新興市場，展現了其管理層的長遠眼光。","comment_en":"Itaú demonstrates exceptional discipline and acumen in capital allocation. Historically, the company has maintained stability through economic cycles and created long-term shareholder value via astute acquisitions, share buybacks, and dividends. Its consistent profitability and effective risk management enable strategic capital deployment at opportune moments, such as investing in new technologies or expanding into emerging markets, showcasing management's foresight."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"結合強大的品牌、轉換成本、卓越的客戶服務和不斷創新的數位平台，Itaú 建立了極高的客戶留存率。客戶黏性透過綜合金融服務、個人化推薦和忠誠度計劃得以加強。這種穩定的客戶基礎為銀行提供了可預測的收入來源，並減少了對獲取新客戶的依賴，是其長期價值的關鍵支撐。","comment_en":"By combining a strong brand, switching costs, excellent customer service, and an innovative digital platform, Itaú achieves very high customer retention rates. Customer stickiness is further enhanced through comprehensive financial services, personalized recommendations, and loyalty programs. This stable customer base provides predictable revenue streams and reduces reliance on new customer acquisition, serving as a key pillar of its long-term value."},"m10_durability":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Itaú 作為巴西領先的金融機構，其業務模式具有高度的持久性。儘管面臨金融科技的挑戰，但其核心的銀行業務（存款、貸款、支付）是經濟的基石，需求穩定。公司持續的技術投入和對監管的適應能力，確保了其在不斷變化的環境中保持競爭力。其穩健的財務狀況和優秀的管理層，使其能夠抵禦經濟波動，長期維持其市場地位。","comment_en":"As a leading financial institution in Brazil, Itaú's business model exhibits high durability. Despite challenges from fintech, its core banking operations (deposits, lending, payments) are economic cornerstones with stable demand. Continuous technological investment and regulatory adaptability ensure its competitiveness in a changing landscape. Its robust financial health and excellent management enable it to withstand economic fluctuations and maintain its market position long-term."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Itaú Unibanco 在巴西金融市場展現出強大的經濟護城河，可被視為一個具有特許經營性質的企業。其領先的品牌聲譽（M1）、嚴格的監管環境（M2）、顯著的規模經濟（M5）以及卓越的營運效率（M7）共同構成了堅實的競爭壁壘。此外，管理層出色的資本配置能力（M8）和高客戶留存率（M9）進一步鞏固了其市場地位。雖然網絡效應（M4）相對較弱，但其綜合實力足以應對挑戰，展現出高度的業務持久性（M10），使其成為一個長期價值投資的優質標的。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Itaú Unibanco possesses a strong economic moat in the Brazilian financial sector, functioning akin to a franchise business. Its leading brand reputation (M1), stringent regulatory environment (M2), significant economies of scale (M5), and operational efficiency (M7) form robust barriers. Furthermore, management's excellent capital allocation (M8) and high customer retention (M9) solidify its market standing. While network effects (M4) are less pronounced, its overall strength allows it to navigate challenges, demonstrating high durability (M10) and making it a prime candidate for long-term value investment.","evidenceHash":"398cde1b8a44b5e765762bed85efa71eb4c0103891eb116812adeb49316856ae","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":4,"checkedAt":null}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":true,"reference":{"date":"2026-06-30","label":"FY 2026 Q2","period":"quarterly","flow":"ttm","balance":"beginning","rote":26.28103355068082,"warnings":[],"tbvps":3.3592654280962977,"reason":null},"rote":26.28103355068082,"tbvps":3.3592654280962977,"bvps":3.3592654280962977,"g":2.25,"dps_total":0.5203919392542616,"dps_source":"ttmQuarterly","dps_source_date":"2026-06-30","pb_tangible":2.887536042514214,"ke_floor_pct":9,"ke_floor_applied":true,"ke_capm":5.06,"ke":9,"excess_return_fair":11.96,"ddm_fair":9.45},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/ITUB.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/ITUB.png","website":"https://www.itau.com.br","ceo":"Milton Maluhy Filho","full_time_employees":"99600","description":"Itaú Unibanco Holding S.A. delivers a broad spectrum of financial and insurance solutions to both individual and corporate clientele, operating within Brazil and internationally. The company organizes its activities across three primary divisions: Retail Banking, Wholesale Banking, and Activities with the Market and Corporation. Its extensive service portfolio encompasses various deposit instruments, lending products such as loans and credit cards, specialized investment and commercial banking, real estate financing, general financing and investment management, leasing, and foreign exchange services. Additionally, Itaú Unibanco is a prominent insurer, offering property and casualty coverage for losses, damages, or liabilities pertaining to assets and individuals, along with life insurance for death and personal accidents, and reinsurance. Its diverse customer base includes retail consumers (both account and non-account holders), private individuals and legal entities, high-net-worth clients, and micro to small enterprises. Established in 1924 and headquartered in São Paulo, Brazil, the firm adopted its current name, Itaú Unibanco Holding S.A., in April 2009, having previously been known as Itaú Unibanco Banco Múltiplo S.A. It functions as a subsidiary of IUPAR - Itaú Unibanco Participações S.A.","description_en":"Itaú Unibanco Holding S.A. delivers a broad spectrum of financial and insurance solutions to both individual and corporate clientele, operating within Brazil and internationally. The company organizes its activities across three primary divisions: Retail Banking, Wholesale Banking, and Activities with the Market and Corporation. Its extensive service portfolio encompasses various deposit instruments, lending products such as loans and credit cards, specialized investment and commercial banking, real estate financing, general financing and investment management, leasing, and foreign exchange services. Additionally, Itaú Unibanco is a prominent insurer, offering property and casualty coverage for losses, damages, or liabilities pertaining to assets and individuals, along with life insurance for death and personal accidents, and reinsurance. Its diverse customer base includes retail consumers (both account and non-account holders), private individuals and legal entities, high-net-worth clients, and micro to small enterprises. Established in 1924 and headquartered in São Paulo, Brazil, the firm adopted its current name, Itaú Unibanco Holding S.A., in April 2009, having previously been known as Itaú Unibanco Banco Múltiplo S.A. It functions as a subsidiary of IUPAR - Itaú Unibanco Participações S.A.","description_zh":"**Itaú Unibanco Holding S.A. (ITUB) 業務營運概述**\n\nItaú Unibanco Holding S.A.（ITUB）為巴西及國際客戶提供多元化的金融與保險解決方案。公司營運劃分為三大核心業務板塊：個人金融（Retail Banking）、企業金融（Wholesale Banking）及市場與法人業務（Activities with the Market and Corporation）。\n\n其金融服務範疇廣泛，涵蓋各類存款產品、貸款、信用卡、專業投資銀行、商業銀行、不動產融資、一般融資與資產管理、租賃及外匯業務。此外，ITUB亦是重要的保險提供者，業務包括財產險（涵蓋資產與個人之損失、損害或責任）、人壽保險（針對死亡及意外事故）以及再保險。\n\nITUB的客戶群多元，包含一般零售客戶（含帳戶與非帳戶持有者）、個人與法人客戶、高資產客戶，以及微型至小型企業。該公司成立於1924年，總部位於巴西聖保羅，並於2009年更名為現名。ITUB為IUPAR - Itaú Unibanco Participações S.A. 的子公司。","address":"PraCa Alfredo Egydio de Souza Aranha","city":"São Paulo","state":"SP","zip":"04344-902","country":"BR","phone":"55 11 5019 1267","full_address":"PraCa Alfredo Egydio de Souza Aranha, São Paulo, SP 04344-902, BR","range_52w":"6.81553-10.2","year_high":10.2,"year_low":6.81553,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":6.81553,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-09-09","name":"Orestes Vanzo Carlos","title":"officer: SMEs Officer (retail segment)","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":74643,"price":8.38,"total_val":0.63},{"date":"2026-07-08","name":"Orestes Vanzo Carlos","title":"officer: SMEs Officer (retail segment)","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":60000,"price":8.24,"total_val":0.49},{"date":"2026-05-11","name":"Egydio Setubal Roberto","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":75923,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-05-11","name":"Villela Marino Ricardo","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":48460,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-05-11","name":"Moreira Salles Pedro","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":75923,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-05-11","name":"Bodin de Moraes Pedro Luiz","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":20998,"p